please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w35-0027\", \"v\": [[\"I think I might have deleted something by accident while clearing out my list earlier — is the snapdragon task in the trash?\", \"Oh thank goodness it's still there, I definitely need that one — could you restore it for me?\"], [\"is the snapdragon task in the trash?\", \"ok pls restore it\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w35-0028\", \"v\": [[\"what's left on top up the lunch account (wk 45)?\", \"spending in April?\", \"tick off the first, delete the second\"], [\"I keep forgetting about this one and it's nagging at me, so what's still left to do on the top up the lunch account (wk 45) plan?\", \"Different thing — I'm trying to get a handle on my budget, so how much did I spend back in April?\", \"Okay, going back to those two tasks from before — I've actually done the first one so tick it off, and the second one you can just delete.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w35-0029\", \"v\": [[\"It's been hanging over me for a while, so could you take care of Wouter in canoe gang and settle up with him?\", \"Oh, and I keep losing track of the ribbon manual paperwork, so could you mark it with a star so it's easier to find?\", \"Also, I want to see where the bigger money went — can you show me the canoe gang expenses over 20 pounds?\"], [\"ok so Wouter in canoe gang, can you uh settle up with him?\", \"oh and umm can you star the ribbon manual paperwork for me\", \"and uh what are the canoe gang expenses that are, like, over 20 pounds?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w35-0030\", \"v\": [[\"add twenty pounds for Wouter's lunch to canoe gang, i paid\"], [\"twenty pounds for Wouter's lunch, canoe gang, I paid\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w35-0031\", \"v\": [[\"I keep thinking of things and then forgetting them, so could you make a note called gift ideas for Ignacio?\", \"Different thing — I was trying to remember what I got up to, so what pictures did I take in August?\", \"This is going to sound silly, but I've got a form to fill in — who's my sister?\"], [\"note: gift ideas for Ignacio\", \"August pics?\", \"who's my sister?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w35-0032\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me which steps of the top up the lunch account (wk 46) job are still open?\", \"Could you narrow that down to just the ones this month, please?\", \"Also, parents evening is thursday at half four — would you add it for me, please?\", \"Could you tell me what the login is for my snorkelling class membership? Just the login, not the password.\", \"And what is the password on it, please?\", \"Could you tell me what my calendar has on it?\"], [\"which steps of top up the lunch account (wk 46) r still open\", \"just the ones this month pls\", \"parents evening thursday at half four, add it\", \"whats the login for the snorkelling class membership, not the pw\", \"ok whats the password on it\", \"and what does my calendar have on it\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w35-0033\", \"v\": [[\"umm what's the… what's the canoe gang total so far?\"], [\"canoe gang total so far?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w35-0034\", \"v\": [[\"Could you show me the Besness trip expenses, please?\"], [\"uh can I see the, um, the Besness trip expenses?\"]]}","ttft_ms":33580,"type":"result","duration_ms":47859,"uuid":"8bd327f9-8d42-4527-951c-48b8b6bcdb47","ttft_stream_ms":1563,"time_to_request_ms":184,"first_content_frame_ms":1563,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22508782,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790279059359.1106,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
